Scope

This licence covers everything in this repository authored by the project: the
model (model/, reference/, lab/input/, lab/reference/, docs/model_v7_6_r1/), the
validation contracts and change policies, the documentation, the Orbital Economy
Lab bench (lab/ except lab/vendor/) and the repository tooling (tools/).

It does NOT cover the third-party packages vendored in lab/vendor/, which keep
their own licences (see lab/LICENSE-NOTICE.md):

  simulation 9.0.0   GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 or later
  csv-parse 5.6.0    MIT

The bench runs on the `simulation` engine. The bench's own source is MIT and
may be reused on its own under MIT; a distribution or network deployment of the
bench together with `simulation` must also satisfy the AGPL for `simulation`.
